{
  "_comment": [
    "Tags carry the broad strokes and reach biomes nobody here has heard of. The weights say what the tag set",
    "is too coarse for: a sunflower plain is lovely and no tag in the table says so, and a jungle is",
    "magnificent without being pretty. A palm beach is let in, being in no Age until",
    "something asks for it, and it grows only on a mild coast (notes/palm-beach-design.md).",
    "",
    "And three of a clear blue sky, white cloud, green grass, autumn leaves, drifting petals, frequent",
    "rainbows and brighter stars are offered to every beautiful Age, each yielding to anything the book says."
  ],
